### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:4040/health

### Register
POST http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "kaiden.2h2@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirmPassword": "password123",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01",
  "timeZone" :"Europe/London"
}

### Verify Email
POST http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawToken" : ""
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identity": "john_doe",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Resend Verification
POST http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kaiden.2h2@gmail.com"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/logout

### Google OAuth Login (redirects to Google)
GET http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/google

### Google OAuth Callback (handles redirect from Google)
GET http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/google/callback

### GitHub OAuth Login (redirects to GitHub)
GET http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/github

### GitHub OAuth Callback (handles redirect from GitHub)
GET http://localhost:4040/v1/auth/github/callback

